<title>VENEZUELA: Ceramica Carabobo Q1 net slumps.</title>
<headline>Ceramica Carabobo Q1 net slumps.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit 64.2 million bolivars vs 252.3 million</p>
<p>Sales 10.5 bln bolivars vs 13.7 bln</p>
<p>Cost of sales 8.0 bln bolivars vs 9.2 bln</p>
<p>Administrative costs 1.5 bln bolivars vs 1.9 bln</p>
<p>Other costs/gains 366.9 million bolivars vs 1.4 billion bolivars</p>
<p>Notes: Period ending December 31 1996</p>
<p>Results are consolidated and inflation-adjusted but not audited</p>
<p>Ceramica Carabobo manufactures ceramic products.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
